libc++ (LLVM 18) <sstream>: converting `o << "ab"' drops
basic_streambuf<wchar_t, char_traits<char>>::xsgetn / xsputn
(streambuf:268/276), a bogus instance created while deducing the deleted
`operator<<(basic_ostream<wchar_t, _Traits> &, char16_t)'
(cpp_deduction_failure_does_not_instantiate_pattern), plus the __format
drops (cpp20_requires_expression_parameter_pack_of_differing_types).
clang++ 18 -stdlib=libc++ accepts this program, and it fails only its WRONG
assertion.
